	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName> noster praestabit,<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Vgl. oben <ref target="file12334">Nr. 2287</ref>, 2-11, wo <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName> erklärt, dass er durch Schweigen eine Fortentwicklung des unwillkommenen Streites zu verhindern versuche.</note> quod hactenus neque literis tuis<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Nicht erhalten, aber oben in <ref target="file12158">Nr. 2111</ref>, 10, erwähnt. - Dies ist der erste Brief von <persName ref="p2449">Claudius Pius Peutinger</persName> an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>responderim proque misso munusculo<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Die "Orthodoxa <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae confessio"; s. oben <ref target="file12158">Nr. 2111</ref>, 7-11; 2134 und Anm. 1.</note> nullas habuerim gratias, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quod mihi te, viro doctissimo, autore gratissimum fuit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Caeterum eo multum conturbatus sum, quod videam vulnus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>huius dissidii tanto publici negotii incommodo recru<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>descere; quod non dixerim culpa vestra fieri, qui amara <persName ref="p1974">Martini</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>scripta<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> "Kurtz bekentnis"; s. oben <ref target="file12108">Nr. 2061</ref>, Anm. 7.</note> legerim, sed tamen utrinque caussa salva silenti<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>um optimae defensioni<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> optima defen.</note> praestitisset, cum ea apud amicos <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>non sit amplius opus, quod prioribus scriptis iuditia satis <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>firmari<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">firmari <hi>korrigiert aus</hi> informari.</note> possint.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Apud inimicos autem tam nihil agimus <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quam nos, quam publicam evangelii caussam magis illorum libidini <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>prostituimus; quae non ideo dixerim, ut, mi d. <lb xml:id="p1z13"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, qui in vestros huius mali caussam reiiciam, sed quod <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>piis ac bonis viris ad concordiam atque publici negotii ratio<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>nes utiles pro mea in deum et relligionem fide monitor <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>esse cuperem.<pb type="edition" next="653"/></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Praeterea amiciciam tuam gratissimam mihi <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>esse scito, quam ego, cum expetere deberem, abs te human<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>iter oblatam<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Bei der Sendung der oben erwähnten Schrift; s. Anm. 3.</note> promptissimo accipio animo, sincere <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>et candide observabo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName>, 20. <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>novembris anno 1545.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Tuus <persName ref="p2449">Cl<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>. P. Peutinger</persName>, iuris <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>consultus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf f. [153b]v.:]<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Papierverlust durch Entfernung des Siegels. Fehlender Text ergänzt in Anlehnung an die Adresse der zwei erhaltenen Briefe <persName ref="p2449">Peutingers</persName> an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>.</hi></note></note>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Doctissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Hainricho <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, christianae pietatis [atque veri]<lb xml:id="p4z3"/>tatis professori, amico [suo c]<lb xml:id="p4z4"/>arissimo.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Vorliegender Brief wie auch die Briefe <ref target="file12334">Nr. 2287</ref>. 2289f. 2293-2296 wurden <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> durch <persName ref="p7228">Zwingli d.J.</persName> überbracht; s. oben <ref target="file12337">Nr. 2290</ref>, 57f; unten 2302, 1-9; 2303.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
